            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ijo ba ituŋanan, iŋai bo ijo yeniboŋokini Edeke? Epedori kereka ibore yenisubuna alimokin yenikesubuni ebe, “Kanukinyo kiisubia eoŋ kwana?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
